{"articleNo":"81733","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=81733&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[산학융합사업단] 금오공대 전자의료기기개발 실무인력양성과정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.04.17","hit":"3903","attachments":[{"name":"홍보자료(강의일정).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=81733&attachNo=72034"},{"name":"신청서_.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=81733&attachNo=72604"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">전자의료기기개발 실무인력양성과정</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">산학융합캠퍼스사업(QWL)은&nbsp;전자의료기기개발을 위한 실무인력양성과정을 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">아래와 같이 개설하오니 신청바랍니다. </span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 교육기간 : 2013. 04. 23(화) ~ 5. 09(목)</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 강의실 : 그린에너지관 205호</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 강&nbsp;&nbsp; 사 : 추한태교수외&nbsp;7명</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 참가대상 : 기업 재직자 및 재학생</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 교육인원 : 과정별 20명내외 (접수순 마감) </span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 교육과정 : 첨부 파일 참조</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. 교육비 : 무료</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ&nbsp;안내사항</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 주차권(외부인)&nbsp;및 중식 제공합니다. </span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 수료증 발급합니다. </span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ 교육신청</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 신청기간 : 2013. 4. 19(금) 18:00</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 신청방법 : 신청서 다운로드후 이메일 발송 </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:bbbbann@kumoh.ac.kr\">bbbbann@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 문의 :&nbsp;담당 방주영, 478-7256</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ㅇ 주관 : 첨단의료기기연구소, 산학융합사업단</span></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">강의일정 및 신청서는 첨부파일에 있으니 확인바랍니다.</font></p><p><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"></font>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><font face=\"돋움\">※4월 26일(금) </font>방사선영상진단기기 강의가</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">5월 2일(목)로 변경되었습니다.</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">시간은 13:00~16:00 로 동일합니다.</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">참고해주시기 바랍니다.</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
